model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Authorization refuses a client ID that starts with a documented client-secret prefix for entered, saved and dynamically registered clients before it builds the browser URL. An operator client with such an ID is unavailable before any anonymous authorization check, and its ID and setup instructions are never shown, so automatic sign-in falls through to the next client. The refusal is the protocol failure client_id_looks_like_secret, holds no part of the value, crosses the hosted OAuth wire unchanged and reaches people as the existing invalid_client setup failure. The rule is one file, scripts/oauth-client-id.ts: the hosted deploy check imports it and upstream preparation copies it unchanged into the SDK."
    }
  }
}
